// Added in OPM
// What physics bodies sound like striking things (code/physics/phys_impact.cpp):
// phys_<material>_<light|heavy|soft>, light and heavy on hard ground by the
// thing's weight, soft on earth, grass, sand, snow or carpet. The code scales
// volume by how hard the knock was and pitch by the weight, so these set only
// the character of each. For now all retail recordings; better ones can take
// their place here without touching the code.
// Corpses play the retail snd_bodyfall_<surface> set.

aliascache phys_wood_light1 sound/weapons/foley/GrenadeBounceHard1.wav soundparms 0.8 0.2 1.0 0.15 120 1200 auto loaded maps "m t dm obj lib train"
